'''Big Game Hunter''' (希少種ハンター, ''Kishōshu Hantā'', '''Rare Species Hunter''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]].  It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

